// MERCY_RUMBLEALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P213028913" "You are a blight upon the world!"
// MERCY_RUMBLEALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3697468209" "Now it is time to meet your end!"
// MERCY_RUMBLEALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P284355342" "Back! Back, you spawn of evil!"
// MERCY_RUMBLEALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3158024438" "I relish the opportunity to strike down vermin like you!"
// MERCY_RUMBLEALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P252892304" "You shall beg me for mercy!"
// MERCY_RUMBLEALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3607982447" "Your day has come."
// MERCY_RUMBLEALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2125856789" "You will be defeated!"
// MERCY_RUMBLEALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1902757140" "The light will shine upon your broken body!"
// MERCY_RUMBLEALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1457537647" "Down with thee!"

// MERCY_RUMBLEALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P849139895" "Into the breach!"
// MERCY_RUMBLEALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3690311804" "More vermin to deal with!"
// MERCY_RUMBLEALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1755663627" "The light will be cast into your darkness!"
// MERCY_RUMBLEALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2552586854" "You will flee before us!"
// MERCY_RUMBLEALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1376239993" "More vermin come to face their deaths!"

// MERCY_CAUGHTALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1650430997" "Reveal your secrets, vermin!"
// MERCY_CAUGHTALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2295016710" "You WILL talk. I will see to that."
// MERCY_CAUGHTALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1282948339" "Cease your drivel, fool."
// MERCY_CAUGHTALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1901885224" "You will see the light."
// MERCY_CAUGHTALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3338874245" "With defeat comes absolution. You will talk."

// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2317549898" "I ain't talkin'."
// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2161564534" "Why don't you guys get lost?"
// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1520182683" "Someone should put a stop to you guys."
// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3188170223" "Get outta my face."
// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3558020270" "What you got against us?"
// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3949950706" "It's not polite to point a gun."
// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2120668908" "You're gonna get yours."
// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P660795718" "How much will it cost to let us go?"
// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2752187491" "You better watch your backs."
// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P285399490" "Get outta Mercy."
// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4104658728" "Mercy's ours!"
// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P914062534" "I'm going to bet you end up in a shallow grave."

// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1783165861" "Hold 'em back, I'll get reinforcements!"
// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P747416980" "I'll be right back!"
// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4046789649" "Thanks for savin' my hide!"
// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3668794008" "I'm not running, I'm regrouping."
// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1781623063" "Teach him a lesson!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2436386624" "Follow this route, gentlemen.   We shall continue the path until this route has been exhausted."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2153664165" "This way, gents."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P551635278" "Eyes forward, gentlemen.  Crimson Cove is notorious for its little 'surprises'."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2032206518" "Knave!  Watch yourself!  I've my eye on you now!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4158088107" "This...place...is a breeding ground for moral depravity."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2735493021" "To arms!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P770143349" "Gentlemen!  To arms!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3930991369" "You knave!  This breath shall be your last!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2663795251" "For honor and protection of the magic!"

